   1:Source/core/cookie_jar.c **** /*
   2:Source/core/cookie_jar.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — cookie_jar.c
   3:Source/core/cookie_jar.c ****  * RFC 6265 cookie jar (port of Source/core/cookie_jar.lua). See cookie_jar.h.
   4:Source/core/cookie_jar.c ****  * Every quirk of the Lua reference is preserved: name/value validation,
   5:Source/core/cookie_jar.c ****  * domain acceptance rules, path defaulting, the three Expires formats,
   6:Source/core/cookie_jar.c ****  * Max-Age<=0 / past-Expires delete semantics, dedupe by key with identical
   7:Source/core/cookie_jar.c ****  * value+expires no-op, 300-cap, lazy prune in getHeader, prune-without-save.
   8:Source/core/cookie_jar.c ****  */
